find: found.push(text(index + 1));
replace: let _ = index;
caught-by:
    rules::pty_keys::tests::a_raw_key_sent_to_a_pty_fails

[break] public-words-exact-word-takes-a-plural
rule: An `exact` word takes no plural: `each test locks its folder` is ordinary prose.
